# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Email Writer (Google ADK) — service environment
#
# This service holds NO LLM credentials. The provider, model, API key / base URL
# and temperature are sent per request by the backend, from the user's in-app
# settings (Settings → AI providers). So there is nothing to configure here.
#
# With no LLM sent on a request, the service returns a local fallback email —
# no API calls, no key required.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────